<section class="card p-3 my-3"><h5>Application errors &amp; maintenance</h5><p class="text-muted">Latest 200 error groups. Error type, source location and a correlation fingerprint help investigation without exposing customer data, passwords, query parameters or payment keys.</p>
<p>Database: <span class="badge bg-success">Connected</span> · Maintenance last completed (UTC): <?= $h($heartbeat?:'Never') ?> · Storage available: <?= number_format((float)disk_free_space(__DIR__.'/../../config')/1073741824,1) ?> GB</p>
